                <pb facs="1449" n="1291" xml:id="pg1291"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-05-21"><hi rendition="#italic">May 21,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Meyer states that the British consul has reported to him that Stuart,
                    American vice-consul at Batum, was murdered last night, and that the murderers
                    are unknown.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
